# Living Room Kit: the normal, healthy smart-home automation state.
# Compiles clean with zero firewall findings, emits all four artifacts, and
# drives the appliance (green LED) once the sensor fires.
# Wiring: physical pin 18 (BCM 24) -> appliance output;
#         physical pin 23 (BCM 11) -> PIR/motion sensor input.
LINK PIN 18 TO AC_COOLING_SYSTEM AS OUTPUT
LINK PIN 23 TO MOTION_SENSOR AS INPUT

ATOMIC
    IF MOTION_SENSOR IS HIGH THEN
        TRIGGER AC_COOLING_SYSTEM HIGH
        LOG "Motion detected. Adjusting climate matrix safely."
    END
END